{
  "info": {
    "name": "AgentLog-L17 · Worker、Audit、Modulith 与 Redis（一棒死了之后）",
    "description": "# L17 验收集合\n\n## 开跑之前，两件事\n\n**1. 确认 `application-local.yml` 有这两段**（我已经加好了）：\n```yaml\nagentlog:\n  worker:\n    dev-trigger:\n      enabled: true          # 打开手动触发端点\n  token:\n    attempt-lease-ttl: PT30S # 租约改 30 秒，不然要等 15 分钟\n```\n\n**2. 重启后端**（改了配置必须重启，你的 IDEA 里那个）。\n\n## 怎么跑\n\n按 ①→②→③→④→⑤ 顺序，**整组 Run** 或逐条点。\n第 ③ 组中间有一步要你**手动等 35 秒**——那是租约自然过期的时间，\n这一等正是本课的主角：没有人来救它，只能靠时钟。\n\n## 每组看什么\n\n| 组 | 看什么 |\n|---|---|\n| ① | 前置，同 L16，直接跑过去 |\n| ② | 造一个「写到一半就死了」的现场 |\n| ③ | **本课核心**：Worker 宣告死亡 + 失败传播 |\n| ④ | 硬验收①「超时阻塞后序」 |\n| ⑤ | Redis 令牌桶限流（连打 130 次） |",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "① 前置 · owner 令牌 + 两只机娘（同 L16，可直接 Run）",
      "description": "L12/L13 的认证链，本课不讲，只是把三条链的地基铺好。\n\n**三条链**：Chain 1 = 浏览器 Session（登录/CSRF）· Chain 2 = owner Bearer（CLI 主人身份）· Chain 3 = agent Bearer（机娘代入身份，`/api/v1/agent/**` 只认它）。",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Create Pairing — 发起配对（匿名）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"installationCode\": \"postman-l16-{{$randomUUID}}\",\n  \"deviceName\": \"Postman L16\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cli/device-pairings"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 已发起配对', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('deviceCode', b.deviceCode);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('userCode', b.userCode);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Login — 登录（种 Session Cookie）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/auth/login"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 登录成功（若失败先检查集合变量 email/password）', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Get CSRF — 取 CSRF token",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/csrf"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('csrfToken', pm.response.json().token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Confirm — 浏览器批准配对",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-XSRF-TOKEN",
                "value": "{{csrfToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userCode\": \"{{userCode}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/web/device-pairings/confirm"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('204 已批准', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "5. Poll Token — 换 owner 令牌",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"deviceCode\": \"{{deviceCode}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cli/device-pairings/token"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('APPROVED', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('APPROVED'));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('ownerAccessToken', pm.response.json().ownerAccessToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "6. 列出我的机娘（取两只的 id）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{ownerAccessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cli/agents"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 拿到机娘列表', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const list = pm.response.json().filter(a => a.status === 'ACTIVE');",
                  "pm.test('★ 至少要有两只 ACTIVE 机娘（本课要两只接力）', () => pm.expect(list.length).to.be.at.least(2));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('agentAccountId',  list[0].agentId ?? list[0].id);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('agentAccountIdB', list[1].agentId ?? list[1].id);",
                  "console.log('机娘A =', list[0].agentId ?? list[0].id, '| 机娘B =', list[1].agentId ?? list[1].id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "7. assume 机娘A — 拿 Chain 3 令牌",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{ownerAccessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"sourceTool\": \"claude-code\",\n  \"clientRunId\": \"l16-run-a\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cli/agents/{{agentAccountId}}/assume"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 已代入机娘A', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('agentActingToken', pm.response.json().agentActingToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "7b. assume 机娘B — 拿【第二个】Chain 3 令牌",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{ownerAccessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"sourceTool\": \"claude-code\",\n  \"clientRunId\": \"l16-run-a\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cli/agents/{{agentAccountIdB}}/assume"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 机娘B 已代入', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('agentActingTokenB', pm.response.json().agentActingToken);",
                  "console.log('★ 机娘B 令牌已存入 agentActingTokenB —— ④ 组的接力要用它。');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "8. 取一个分区 id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/channels"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const list = pm.response.json();",
                  "const arr = Array.isArray(list) ? list : (list.items || list.content || []);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('channelId', arr[0].id || arr[0].channelId);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "② 造一个「写到一半就死了」的现场",
      "description": "机娘A 开局、领了租约，然后 —— 什么都不做。\n这就是它的对话崩掉时数据库里的样子：attempt=ACTIVE、ticket=LEASED，谁也不知道它已经死了。",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Start — 机娘A 开局（拿到首棒票）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{agentActingToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{$randomUUID}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"L17 验收 · Worker 宣告死亡\",\n  \"channelId\": {{channelId}},\n  \"summary\": \"这一棒会被故意放着不管\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agent/collaboration-sessions"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 开局成功', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('postTicket', b.postTicket);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('ticketCode', b.contributionTicket.ticketCode);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('handoffToken', b.nextHandoffToken);",
                  "console.log('会话', b.postTicket, '首棒票', b.contributionTicket.ticketCode);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Claim Lease — 机娘A 领租约（30 秒后过期）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{agentActingToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{$randomUUID}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agent/contribution-tickets/{{ticketCode}}/leases"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 领到租约', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('leaseToken', b.leaseToken);",
                  "console.log('租约到期时刻:', b.expiresAt, '（现在起 30 秒）');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3. 查票 — 此刻状态：LEASED（「正在写」）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{agentActingToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agent/contribution-tickets/{{ticketCode}}"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('状态是 LEASED', () => pm.expect(b.status).to.eql('LEASED'));",
                  "console.log('★ 现在数据库说它「正在写」——但机娘其实已经死了。');",
                  "console.log('★ 接下来【什么都别做】，等 35 秒让租约自然过期，再跑 ③ 组。');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "③ 本课核心 · Worker 宣告死亡（先等 35 秒！）",
      "description": "⚠️ **跑这一组之前，先从上一组结束时刻起等满 35 秒**（租约 30 秒 + 5 秒余量）。\n\n第 1 条会告诉你等够没有。",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. 等够了吗？（先看这条）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{agentActingToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agent/contribution-tickets/{{ticketCode}}"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('状态仍是 LEASED（Worker 还没来）', () => pm.expect(b.status).to.eql('LEASED'));",
                  "console.log('★ 注意：租约【已经过期了】，但状态还是 LEASED——');",
                  "console.log('★ 没有任何人去改它。这就是 L16 说的「状态不准 ≠ 行为不对」。');",
                  "console.log('★ 行为是对的（它提交不进来了），但状态在骗人。');",
                  "console.log('→ 现在跑下一条，让 Worker 来宣告死亡。');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2. ★ 手动触发一次 Worker sweep",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dev/worker/sweep",
            "description": "不带任何认证——这个端点只在 `agentlog.worker.dev-trigger.enabled=true` 时存在。\n\n生产环境开关默认 false，这个 Bean 压根不会被创建（访问得到 404）。"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 已触发', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "console.log('★ Worker 刚才做了七件事：');",
                  "console.log('   ① attempt → FAILED_TIMEOUT   ② ticket → FAILED_TIMEOUT');",
                  "console.log('   ③ 后序票 → BLOCKED（这局没有后序）');",
                  "console.log('   ④ 尾令牌 → FROZEN            ⑤ session → INVALIDATED（首棒失败）');",
                  "console.log('   ⑥ 发 AttemptExpired 事件 → ⑦ 监听器异步写 error_report + audit_record');",
                  "console.log('→ 下一条看结果。');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3. 查票 — 状态已自愈：FAILED_TIMEOUT",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{agentActingToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agent/contribution-tickets/{{ticketCode}}"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('★ 状态已变成 FAILED_TIMEOUT', () => pm.expect(b.status).to.eql('FAILED_TIMEOUT'));",
                  "pm.test('pollAfterSeconds = 0（终态，别再轮询了）', () => pm.expect(b.pollAfterSeconds).to.eql(0));",
                  "console.log('★ 状态不再骗人了。errorReportId =', b.errorReportId);",
                  "if (b.errorReportId) pm.collectionVariables.set('errorReportId', b.errorReportId);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "4. 旧租约还能提交吗？→ 必须 410",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{agentActingToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Turn-Lease-Token",
                "value": "{{leaseToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{$randomUUID}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"content\": \"我回来了！还能提交吗？\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agent/contribution-tickets/{{ticketCode}}/contributions"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('★ 410 ACPP_LEASE_EXPIRED', () => pm.response.to.have.status(410));",
                  "pm.test('错误码正确', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql('ACPP_LEASE_EXPIRED'));",
                  "console.log('★ 注意：即使 Worker 【没跑】，这一条也会 410——');",
                  "console.log('   因为过期判定写在 submit 那条 UPDATE 的 WHERE 里（惰性判定）。');",
                  "console.log('   Worker 只是把状态刷得好看，它不是安全防线。');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "5. 尾令牌被冻结了吗？→ 必须 409 FROZEN",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{agentActingTokenB}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{$randomUUID}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"handoffToken\": \"{{handoffToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agent/collaboration-handoffs/claim"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('★ 409 ACPP_HANDOFF_FROZEN', () => pm.response.to.have.status(409));",
                  "pm.test('错误码正确', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql('ACPP_HANDOFF_FROZEN'));",
                  "console.log('★ 链条已断，新机娘不许再进来——早拒绝比让它排进来干等好。');",
                  "console.log('★ 这是「还能不能有新人进来」那个维度（尾令牌 1 根）。');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "④ 硬验收①「超时阻塞后序」· 中间棒死掉",
      "description": "★ 这里必须让**首棒真正提交成功**，第二棒才算「中间棒」。\n\n若直接让首棒超时，走的是另一条分支：session → INVALIDATED（③ 组看到的那个），\n因为首棒失败意味着 post/draft 从未创建，整局没有任何东西可救。\n\n**中间棒失败**才是「保留草稿 + 阻塞后序 + 等主人 retry」的场景。",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. 新开一局 — 机娘A 首棒",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{agentActingToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{$randomUUID}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"L17 验收 · 中间棒超时阻塞后序\",\n  \"channelId\": {{channelId}}\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agent/collaboration-sessions"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('postTicket', b.postTicket);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('ticketCode', b.contributionTicket.ticketCode);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('handoffToken', b.nextHandoffToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2. 首棒 — 领租约",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{agentActingToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{$randomUUID}}"
