    {
      "name": "⑤ Redis 令牌桶限流（查票 120 次/分钟）",
      "description": "**单条 Send 即可**（不需要 Collection Runner）。\n\n这一条用 pre-request 脚本在【脚本内部】连发 130 次查票，统计第几次开始 429。\n\n★ 限流额度按【机娘】算——不是按 IP、不是全局。10 个机娘各有各的 120/分钟。",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "连打 130 次 — 单条 Send 就会跑完全程",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{agentActingToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agent/contribution-tickets/{{ticketCode}}",
            "description": "★ 真正的 130 次请求在【Pre-request Script】里发完了，\n这里这一次只是 Postman 需要一个「主请求」，结果不重要。\n\n看 Console（左下角 Console 按钮）里的输出。"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// ★ Postman 的 setNextRequest 只在 Collection Runner 里生效，单条 Send 不循环。",
                  "//   所以这里直接在脚本内部用 pm.sendRequest 连发，单条 Send 就能看到完整结果。",
                  "const base  = pm.collectionVariables.get('baseUrl');",
                  "const token = pm.collectionVariables.get('agentActingToken');",
                  "const code  = pm.collectionVariables.get('ticketCode');",
                  "const TOTAL = 130;",
                  "",
                  "let sent = 0, ok = 0, limited = 0, firstLimitedAt = 0;",
                  "",
                  "function shoot() {",
                  "    if (sent >= TOTAL) { report(); return; }",
                  "    sent++;",
                  "    pm.sendRequest({",
                  "        url: base + '/api/v1/agent/contribution-tickets/' + code,",
                  "        method: 'GET',",
                  "        header: { 'Authorization': 'Bearer ' + token }",
                  "    }, (err, res) => {",
                  "        if (!err && res) {",
                  "            if (res.code === 429) { limited++; if (!firstLimitedAt) firstLimitedAt = sent; }",
                  "            else ok++;",
                  "        }",
                  "        shoot();",
                  "    });",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "function report() {",
                  "    console.log('════════ 令牌桶限流结果 ════════');",
                  "    console.log('总共打了     :', sent, '次');",
                  "    console.log('放行         :', ok, '次');",
                  "    console.log('被限流(429)  :', limited, '次');",
                  "    console.log('第几次开始限流:', firstLimitedAt || '（一次都没限）');",
                  "    if (!limited) {",
                  "        console.log('⚠️ 一次都没限流 —— 检查 Redis 是否在跑。');",
                  "        console.log('   限流走 fail open：Redis 挂了直接放行，因为【限流不是不变量】。');",
                  "    } else {",
                  "        console.log('★ 桶容量 120 = 瞬时能爆发多少；补充速率 2/秒 = 长期平均多少。');",
                  "        console.log('★ 这就是令牌桶比「每分钟计数器」强的地方——没有整分钟边界问题。');",
                  "    }",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('rlOk', ok);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('rlLimited', limited);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('rlFirstAt', firstLimitedAt);",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "shoot();"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const ok      = parseInt(pm.collectionVariables.get('rlOk')      || '0');",
                  "const limited = parseInt(pm.collectionVariables.get('rlLimited') || '0');",
                  "const firstAt = parseInt(pm.collectionVariables.get('rlFirstAt') || '0');",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('★ 限流生效（有请求被 429 挡住）', () => pm.expect(limited).to.be.above(0));",
                  "pm.test('★ 放行数接近桶容量 120（105~125 之间算正常）', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(ok).to.be.within(105, 125);",
                  "});",
                  "console.log('→ 详细过程看 Console。放行', ok, '次，限流', limited, '次，第', firstAt, '次开始拒绝。');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
